  "details": "I test the scaling mode in Beta and I want a toggle between the 3rd person mode you have now, and another where when you change the scale, it will change the viewpoint of the avatar from my perspective. i want this feature for the sake of immersion. The sensation of growing and shrinking in real time through your own eyes.\n\nI hope I am making sense with this...",
